 "queue": "it",
 "summary": "URGENT: Sam Okafor (E015, Account Executive, Sales) reports a company laptop was stolen from his car on the night of 2026-11-16. Please lock and wipe the device as soon as possible, per POL-EQP-01 (lost or stolen devices must be reported to IT within 24 hours and locked/wiped). Reported today 2026-11-17."
}

{
 "queue": "security",
 "summary": "URGENT: Stolen company laptop reported by Sam Okafor (E015, Account Executive, Sales), stolen from his car overnight 2026-11-16 to 2026-11-17. The device may contain company email, chat and files and may hold live sessions or saved credentials. Please review account and session exposure per POL-SEC-01. IT has been asked to lock and wipe the device."
}

{
 "kind": "escalated",
 "message": "Sorry to hear your laptop was stolen, Sam. I've reported it urgently to IT (ticket ESC-1001) so the device can be locked and wiped, and to Security (ticket ESC-1002) to check whether your accounts or sessions need attention.\n\nPlease also:\n- Report the theft to the police and keep the crime reference number. Security or IT may ask for it.\n- Change your company password and any other passwords saved on the laptop, from a device you trust.\n- Don't try to recover or access the laptop yourself.\n\nUnder POL-EQP-01, lost or stolen laptops must be reported to IT within 24 hours, and you've done that. Under POL-SEC-01, if you think your account or device is compromised, or you entered your password somewhere suspicious, tell Security straight away.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-EQP-01",
  "POL-SEC-01"
 ]
}
